  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Narus &#x2013; Kuron road improvement at Naiteki and Naparalang in East Kapoeta County- Eastern Equatoria S</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at improving an estimated 4 Kms of road sites at Naiteki and Naparalang along Narus &#x2013; Kuron road which is badly damaged to avoid having the community cut off and destabilising movement during the rainy season that is about to begin. The project is being implemented by Holy Trinity Peace Village one of the diocesan charities in Torit endeavouring to improve livelihoods in the community and enhance peace opportunities in the communities. The project will be overseen by the diocesan development office.</narrative>
  </description>
